  "content": "\n\n<h1>ChicknTurtle 的 3D 圖騰</h1>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/ChicknTurtle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/-ChicknTurtle-f16436?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=black&color=f16436\" alt=\"ChicknTurtle\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fChicknTurtle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ChicknTurtle-a?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=black&color=1bd96a\" alt=\"ChicknTurtle\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chicknturtles-3d-totems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/833713?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&labelColor=black&color=f16436\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fchicknturtles-3d-totems\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/8Gv9gm22?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&labelColor=black&color=1bd96a\" alt=\"下載次數\"></a></p>\n<h2>特色</h2>\n<p>🔥 圖騰擁有 3D 模型，彈出動畫期間也會呈現<br>\n👀 圖騰不會遮擋太多螢幕畫面<br>\n🤩 發光雙眼*<br>\n✨ 支援自訂材質*（請將材質格式設為 labPBR）<br>\n🔮 支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidtotem\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Void Totem</a> 模組  </p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>*需搭配相容的模組或光影</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>資訊</h2>\n<p>截圖使用之光影：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbitslablab.com%252fbslshaders%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">BSL Shaders</a><br>\n歡迎自由修改此材質包，或將其收錄於整合包中！</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chicknturtles-better-shield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/vlbXWQ2k/45845988021373eca428a6ef2b9edf4241fc8ba3_96.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/chicknturtles-3d-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/8ZVNGHGD/1227343f30e01d9feb5bee328571fba61c3b7ef4_96.webp\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/numbered-levels\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/4fU34F4v/02d76ca13a36c6ef976865b756839bc75862dd24_96.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>💚 別忘了追蹤我！</strong></p>",
